<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'60px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei', display:'flex', flexDirection:'column' }}>
<Box style={{ height:46, flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'space-between' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'baseline', gap:18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>技术路线与关键决策</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 2.4–2.6 节 · 九步法设计过程</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>FTDMS · 总体设计报告</Text><Image src="assets/logo_icon.png" style={{ width: 36, height: 36, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:1, background:'#CFD9D2', marginTop:8, marginBottom:20 }}></Box>
<Box style={{ height:462, flexDirection:'column', gap:18 }}><Box style={{ height:330, flexDirection:'row', gap:20 }}><Box style={{ flex:1, background:'#F4F8F5', border:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'14px 18px', flexDirection:'column', gap:10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>架构与前端</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>前后端分离：2 人并行，手机端只依赖 HTTP 契约<br />Vue 3 + Capacitor：复用既有页面，12-02 前可交 APK<br />Spring Boot 3.3：JPA 与 Security 成熟<br />JPA：实体与表一一对应，复杂统计在 service 聚合</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, background:'#F4F8F5', border:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'14px 18px', flexDirection:'column', gap:10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>身份与 AI</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>JWT 无状态：不存会话，登出用内存黑名单<br />本地 Ollama：数据不出服务器，CPU 推理需降级<br />后端算数：模型只解释摘要，结果可复算<br />服务端统计：Web 与 App 口径一致</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, background:'#F4F8F5', border:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'14px 18px', flexDirection:'column', gap:10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>验证与交付</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>自动化 + 手工：模型用本地桩验证降级<br />统一响应封套 + 业务码，HTTP 200 也检查 code<br />H2 可零依赖试跑，演示环境不确定时仍可复现<br />文档、WBS、甘特图与测试记录同一套版本</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height:114, background:'#F4F8F5', padding:'12px 18px', flexDirection:'column', gap:8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>关键设计决策记录 ADR-01～08</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>ADR-01～08：独立建模、营养快照、服务端算数、先算后解释、降级、JWT、统一封套、H2 试跑，均记录理由与影响。</Text></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:50, marginTop:9, background:'#F4F8F5', flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', padding:'0 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>所有决策指向同一目标：口径可复算、模块可替换、交付不依赖额外运维组件。</Text></Box>
</Slide>
